OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome
OL,6,Fbrightness to east through this
OL,7,Fafternoon but quickly turning cloudier
OL,8,Ffrom the northwest for a while
OL,9,Fovernight with showers breaking out.
OL,10,FClearer spells returning by the
OL,11,Fmorning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FThursday will be a fresher
OL,14,Fday than recently. Patchy cloud at
OL,15,Ffirst will break up to give sunny
OL,16,Fspells during the day, although the
OL,17,Fodd light shower is also possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
