OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt looks
OL,6,Flargely dry on Friday and during the
OL,7,Fweekend, with warm sunshine likely,
OL,8,Falthough the odd shower cannot be
OL,9,Fruled out. IT will remain slightly
OL,10,Ffresher with gentle winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
